 a resource to the local filesystem\\n  update      Replace an existing file resource on an element\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -h, --help   help for resource\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1191,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 298,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
