{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000daa9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b225-c4f5-7551-94b6-c0c601dc074b"},"sequence":2991,"recorded_at":1780531400005977,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"83118e98-b6d0-4b7d-9792-f7c513af3eac","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"83118e98-b6d0-4b7d-9792-f7c513af3eac","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"83118e98-b6d0-4b7d-9792-f7c513af3eac"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b23e-c841-75a2-90f8-4a2ddee6006a"},"task_id":"01a0b23e-c841-75a2-90f8-4a2ddee6006a","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b23e-c841-75a2-90f8-4a2ddee6006a","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-49-1\",\n  \"command\": \"mkdir -p /tmp/clonesnap-mutants/run1 && PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/clonesnap/testdata/mutant_harness.py --log-dir /tmp/clonesnap-mutants/run1 2>&1 | tail -n 35; echo \\\"HARNESS_EXIT=$?\\\"\",\n  \"description\": \"Run full mutant battery with logs\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"ok: N-contain-trailing: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Stands forged bytes in for the Guard open of exactly link-escape; every other member still opens through the Guard.\\nok: N-contain-intermediate: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Stands forged bytes in for the Guard open of exactly link-escape/file; every other member still opens through the Guard.\\nok: N-fifo: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Stands forged bytes in for the Guard open of exactly stash-fifo; every other member still opens through the Guard.\\nok: N-unplanned: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly store/zz-extra past the plan gate as durable_payload; every other unplanned key still refuses.\\nok: N-plan-prefix: KILLED (want KILLED) :: TOKEN-PRESERVING: the lookup still compares against the planned keys but admits prefix matches, so store/blob-a-evil rides on store/blob-a. The killer drives the full Capture entry.\\nok: N-plan-order: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly duplicate plan keys; unsorted keys still refuse with the plan detail.\\nok: N-plan-sanitize: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly one UUIDv7 plan key past the sanitizer; every other unsanitized key still refuses. Token preserved.\\nok: N-plan-class: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly class mystery past the vocabulary gate; every other unknown class still refuses.\\nok: N-exclude-credential: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly credential rows as included; the other three always-excluded classes still exclude.\\nok: N-exclude-machine-auth: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly machine_auth rows as included; the other three always-excluded classes still exclude.\\nok: N-exclude-runtime-state: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly runtime_state rows as included; the other three always-excluded classes still exclude.\\nok: N-exclude-transient-lock: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly transient_lock rows as included; the other three always-excluded classes still exclude.\\nok: N-required: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly store/must-have past the required-absent refusal; every other required-absent candidate still refuses.\\nok: N-optional: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Refuses exactly the optional-absent store/maybe that must seal as excluded; every other optional-absent still seals.\\nok: N-race-narrow: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Ignores exactly races naming store/blob-a; races on every other member still refuse.\\nok: N-race-order-capture: KILLED (want KILLED) :: ORDERING: seals and publishes before the race gate; the killer reddens on the published manifests and the non-nil result.\\nok: N-race-order-project: KILLED (want KILLED) :: ORDERING: admits and emits the receipt before the race gate; the killer reddens on the emitted receipt blob.\\nok: N-explicit: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Seals unstable output without acknowledgement for exactly generation-9; every other generation still refuses.\\nok: N-g2: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly generation-9 unstable archives to the target branch; every other unstable still refuses.\\nok: N-maximal: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the three-item unknown manifest to maximal_safe; unknown manifests of every other size still refuse.\\nok: N-fidelity: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly profile ultra; every other unknown profile still refuses.\\nok: N-oversize: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly 11-byte members past the size bound; every other oversized member still refuses.\\nok: N-descriptor-empty: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Seals exactly empty payloads with a zero-size chunk; every non-empty payload still seals clean chunks.\\nok: N-descriptor-offset: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Shifts exactly the second chunk off contiguity; single-chunk descriptors still seal.\\nok: N-workspace-cwd: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the /outside-workspace escape past the escape refusal; every other escape still refuses.\\nok: N-workspace-fingerprints: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly duplicate fingerprints; unsorted fingerprints still refuse with the checkpoint detail.\\nok: N-log-leak: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Leaks exactly store/blob-a payload bytes into the log; every other member still logs digests only.\\nok: N-hook-crash: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Skips the crash-boundary hook for exactly the crash generation; the child exits clean and the parent misses its SIGKILL.\\nok: C-doc-comment: SURVIVED (want SURVIVED) :: Harmless control: a comment-only edit must survive.\\nHARNESS_EXIT=0\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4375,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1094,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
